    130 +- The first time a Queue/NotQueue number is checked, Access queries QueuedProjects.
    131 +- Later checks for the same queue number, Include Without IA setting, and ignore-after threshold reuse the cach
         ed result.
    132 +- This keeps the same decision logic but avoids repeated recordset opens for the same queue number.
